---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="AdSense Readiness Audit" description="AdSense readiness audit for Rozgar Raasta Pakistan. Not applied — do not apply yet.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">AdSense Readiness Audit</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Date: 26 November 2026 (re-verified against the live site) · Status: NOT APPLIED.</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>Verdict: NO-GO — do not apply yet</h2>
			<p>The site is content-ready but <strong>not application-ready</strong>. It went live on 26 November 2026 with zero days of age and zero traffic history. AdSense routinely rejects brand-new sites with no established readership, even when the content is good. Apply only after the site has published daily for at least 4–6 weeks, Google Search Console shows real indexed pages and real search impressions, and there is genuine organic traffic.</p>
			<h2>What AdSense requires</h2>
			<p>Original, useful content with clear navigation; working About, Contact, Privacy Policy and Terms pages; mobile-friendly, fast-loading pages; no copied content, no misleading earning promises, no deceptive ad placement. The site must be complete before applying.</p>
			<h2>Checklist</h2>
			<table>
				<thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Status</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr><td>Original, useful content</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>32 original guides, 1,000–1,900 words each, with FAQs, steps and official source links.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Clear navigation</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Header, mobile menu and footer nav covering all pages.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>About / Contact / Privacy / Terms</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>All four pages live and complete.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Disclaimer + Editorial transparency</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Disclaimer, Editorial Policy and Corrections Policy live.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Mobile usability</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Responsive layouts, no fixed-width overflow, verified at 360–1440 px.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Performance</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Static Astro site, homepage 94 KB, minimal JS, system fonts, SVG graphics only.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>No copied content</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>All guides original; opportunities link to official sources.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>No misleading earning promises</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Re-scanned all guides and pages: income is never described as guaranteed anywhere.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Sitemap + robots.txt + RSS</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Sitemap lists 60 URLs; robots.txt and RSS live.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>HTTPS</td><td>✅ Pass</td><td>Live on Vercel with HTTPS.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Site age / traffic</td><td>❌ Fail</td><td>Live since 26 Nov 2026 (0 days). No traffic history. Main blocker.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Search Console</td><td>❌ Not done</td><td>Property not created, sitemap not submitted.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>Contact email is real</td><td>⚠️ Minor gap</td><td>Contact mailto address is not a real monitored mailbox.</td></tr>
					<tr><td>AdSense account + code</td><td>❌ Not done</td><td>Deliberate — apply only when ready and owner authorises it.</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			<h2>Gaps to close before applying</h2>
			<ol>
				<li>Publish daily for 4–6 weeks and keep opportunities fresh.</li>
				<li>Set up Google Search Console and submit the sitemap; confirm pages get indexed.</li>
				<li>Run Google PageSpeed Insights on the live homepage and fix anything below 80 on mobile.</li>
				<li>Build real organic traffic from search and social. Never buy traffic or use bots.</li>
				<li>Replace the contact email with a real monitored mailbox.</li>
				<li>Re-run this audit after 4–6 weeks. Apply only when every row above passes.</li>
			</ol>
			<h2>After approval (only)</h2>
			<p>Add the official AdSense code exactly as Google provides it. Keep ads separate from navigation and content. Track impressions, CTR, RPM and earnings in the admin dashboard. Monitor invalid traffic and never click your own ads.</p>
			<h2>Absolutely forbidden</h2>
			<p>Clicking our own ads. Asking users to click ads. Paying for ad clicks. Bots, click farms or purchased traffic. Misleading download buttons or accidental-click layouts. Fake page views. Website link clicks and AdSense ad clicks are different events.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
